      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "SylasPassive",
        "name": "Petricite Burst",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "After casting a spell, Sylas stores a charge of Petricite Burst. Sylas's basic attacks will expend a charge and whirl his energized chains around him dealing bonus magic damage to enemies hit. While Sylas has a charge of Petricite Burst, he gains attack speed. ",
        "bodyHtml": "After using an Ability, Sylas gains a charge (max 3 charges). Sylas' Attacks expend a charge to whirl his chains, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(([[si:scalead]]130% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the main target and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(([[si:scalead]]40% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to other surrounding enemies.<br /><br />While he has at least one charge, Sylas gains <span>125% Attack Speed</span>.",
