        "id": "SylasQ",
        "name": "Chain Lash",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Sylas lashes his chains out, intersecting at his targeted location dealing damage to and slowing enemies. <br><br>After a delay, magical energy explodes from the intersection point dealing damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Sylas lashes his chains out, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/60/80/100/120 + ([[si:scaleap]]40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 15/20/25/30/35% for 1.5 seconds. The place where the chains intersect explodes, dealing a further <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/115/170/225/280 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The explosion deals 40% damage to minions.</span>",
