        "summary": "Sylas lunges at an enemy with magical force dealing damage and healing himself against enemy champions.",
        "bodyHtml": "Sylas lunges at an enemy with magical force dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/110/145/180/215 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Against champions, Sylas restores between <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(20/40/60/80/100 + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power) + ([[si:scalehealth]]5% bonus Health))</span> and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(40/80/120/160/200 + (60% Ability Power) + (10% bonus Health)) Health</span> based on his missing Health (max healing at or below 40% Health).",
